'''Here Be Dragons''' (まんぷく秘境, ''Manpuku Hikyō'', '''Completely Uncharted Land''') is the 2nd sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 51st sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|version 7.1]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Regardless of how easily you've beaten [[A New Legend]], this sub-chapter shouldn't be harder than its predecessor. However, be wary of the 2,400% [[Master A.]] in [[Pasta Desert]], and do not underestimate [[Mince Hill|Mince Hill's]] difficulty.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Oldhorn]]: A [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic Enemy]] with massive health and DPS, but slow movement speed and short range. He also has a 100% chance of inflicting Curse.

