==Trivia==
*"Here be dragons" is a phrase for dangerous and/or unexplored territories, imitating the medieval practice of illustrating dragons or other monsters in uncharted areas of maps as a warning of potential danger. This is accurate to the [[Stories of Legend]] ending, which says, "Someone accidentally sat on the time machine's button and now the Cats were sent to a weird place no one had ever heard of."

